  "sentence_placements": [
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-01",
      "text": "Who can answer a question about the unconfirmed facilitator?",
      "source_start": 0.171,
      "source_end": 3.456,
      "sequence_start": 12.16,
      "sequence_end": 15.445
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-01",
      "text": "If the answer lives only in Morgan's head, our carefully designed pieces still do not make an operating system.",
      "source_start": 3.712,
      "source_end": 9.408,
      "sequence_start": 15.701,
      "sequence_end": 21.397
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-01",
      "text": "We need one page that shows how the work travels.",
      "source_start": 9.685,
      "source_end": 12.432,
      "sequence_start": 21.674,
      "sequence_end": 24.421
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "Start with the real sequence on paper.",
      "source_start": 12.619,
      "source_end": 14.454,
      "sequence_start": 24.771,
      "sequence_end": 26.606
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "A request to compare a free digital-skills session enters.",
      "source_start": 14.71,
      "source_end": 18.081,
      "sequence_start": 26.862000000000002,
      "sequence_end": 30.233000000000004
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "A routing rule assigns the evidence-comparison role.",
      "source_start": 18.294,
      "source_end": 21.302,
      "sequence_start": 30.445999999999998,
      "sequence_end": 33.454
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "That role reads the three Harbor course notes and prepares a draft.",
      "source_start": 21.622,
      "source_end": 25.194,
      "sequence_start": 33.774,
      "sequence_end": 37.346000000000004
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "The draft and its short trace wait for Morgan.",
      "source_start": 25.48,
      "source_end": 28.275,
      "sequence_start": 37.632000000000005,
      "sequence_end": 40.427
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "Morgan may propose the option to the team, ask for another date, or hold it.",
      "source_start": 28.638,
      "source_end": 33.032,
      "sequence_start": 40.790000000000006,
      "sequence_end": 45.184
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "The agent has no route to announce, book, buy, or send anything.",
      "source_start": 33.331,
      "source_end": 37.487,
      "sequence_start": 45.483000000000004,
      "sequence_end": 49.639
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-02",
      "text": "Draw that sequence before adding another box.",
      "source_start": 37.888,
      "source_end": 40.299,
      "sequence_start": 50.04,
      "sequence_end": 52.45099999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Chapter Eight gives the operating map five columns.",
      "source_start": 40.662,
      "source_end": 43.606,
      "sequence_start": 52.800999999999995,
      "sequence_end": 55.745
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Trigger: what actually starts this row?",
      "source_start": 43.819,
      "source_end": 46.187,
      "sequence_start": 55.958000000000006,
      "sequence_end": 58.326
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Role: who owns this step?",
      "source_start": 46.464,
      "source_end": 48.384,
      "sequence_start": 58.60299999999999,
      "sequence_end": 60.523
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Tier: what may that role do?",
      "source_start": 48.683,
      "source_end": 50.589,
      "sequence_start": 60.821999999999996,
      "sequence_end": 62.72799999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Handoff: who receives the work next, including a refusal?",
      "source_start": 50.873,
      "source_end": 54.585,
      "sequence_start": 63.01199999999999,
      "sequence_end": 66.72399999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "Evidence: where can a human find the record?",
      "source_start": 54.884,
      "source_end": 57.38,
      "sequence_start": 67.023,
      "sequence_end": 69.519
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "A blank is useful.",
      "source_start": 57.657,
      "source_end": 58.831,
      "sequence_start": 69.79599999999999,
      "sequence_end": 70.97
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "If you cannot name the evidence location, write 'missing.'",
      "source_start": 59.023,
      "source_end": 62.249,
      "sequence_start": 71.162,
      "sequence_end": 74.388
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-03",
      "text": "A tidy imaginary location would hide the work you still need to design.",
      "source_start": 62.496,
      "source_end": 66.144,
      "sequence_start": 74.63499999999999,
      "sequence_end": 78.28299999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "Put the earlier lessons onto those rows.",
      "source_start": 66.422,
      "source_end": 68.662,
      "sequence_start": 78.63299999999998,
      "sequence_end": 80.87299999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "The job sits at the preparation step.",
      "source_start": 69.067,
      "source_end": 71.264,
      "sequence_start": 81.27799999999999,
      "sequence_end": 83.475
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "The Decision Card sits with Morgan.",
      "source_start": 71.456,
      "source_end": 73.291,
      "sequence_start": 83.667,
      "sequence_end": 85.50199999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "Source IDs and expiry checks sit at intake.",
      "source_start": 73.59,
      "source_end": 76.65,
      "sequence_start": 85.80099999999999,
      "sequence_end": 88.86099999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "The receipt and trace travel with the brief.",
      "source_start": 76.936,
      "source_end": 79.24,
      "sequence_start": 89.14699999999999,
      "sequence_end": 91.451
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "Last week's correction remains a memory proposal, pending Morgan's separate approval.",
      "source_start": 79.496,
      "source_end": 83.976,
      "sequence_start": 91.70699999999997,
      "sequence_end": 96.18699999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "The controller's route is a written rule, not a new decision maker.",
      "source_start": 84.318,
      "source_end": 87.75,
      "sequence_start": 96.52899999999997,
      "sequence_end": 99.96099999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-04",
      "text": "A new teammate should be able to point to each item without asking who remembers where it went.",
      "source_start": 88.067,
      "source_end": 93.08,
      "sequence_start": 100.27799999999999,
      "sequence_end": 105.29099999999997
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "The workbook also asks where approval, spend checks, public-safe proof, and rollback sit.",
      "source_start": 93.4,
      "source_end": 99.514,
      "sequence_start": 105.64099999999996,
      "sequence_end": 111.75499999999997
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "This classroom workflow has no spending or public export.",
      "source_start": 99.825,
      "source_end": 103.217,
      "sequence_start": 112.06599999999995,
      "sequence_end": 115.45799999999994
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "Mark those as closed paths with an owner, not as empty arrows that imply they might work.",
      "source_start": 103.495,
      "source_end": 108.657,
      "sequence_start": 115.73599999999996,
      "sequence_end": 120.89799999999994
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "Rollback here means Morgan can withdraw a draft recommendation and record why.",
      "source_start": 108.913,
      "source_end": 113.617,
      "sequence_start": 121.15399999999997,
      "sequence_end": 125.85799999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "It does not undo an announcement, because no announcement happens.",
      "source_start": 113.882,
      "source_end": 117.232,
      "sequence_start": 126.12299999999996,
      "sequence_end": 129.47299999999996
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "If your own paper map has a step without a named owner or a return path, circle it.",
      "source_start": 117.552,
      "source_end": 122.202,
      "sequence_start": 129.79299999999998,
      "sequence_end": 134.44299999999996
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-05",
      "text": "That is the next design task.",
      "source_start": 122.458,
      "source_end": 124.165,
      "sequence_start": 134.69899999999996,
      "sequence_end": 136.40599999999998
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-06",
      "text": "Pause.",
      "source_start": 124.421,
      "source_end": 125.095,
      "sequence_start": 136.75599999999997,
      "sequence_end": 137.43
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-06",
      "text": "Could someone new find the current brief and its source check from this page alone?",
      "source_start": 125.47,
      "source_end": 129.545,
      "sequence_start": 137.805,
      "sequence_end": 141.87999999999994
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-06",
      "text": "Name the first missing handoff.",
      "source_start": 129.95,
      "source_end": 131.785,
      "sequence_start": 142.28499999999997,
      "sequence_end": 144.11999999999995
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Build the Operating Map in your Operating File.",
      "source_start": 132.169,
      "source_end": 134.516,
      "sequence_start": 144.46999999999994,
      "sequence_end": 146.81699999999992
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Use a fictional or approved example.",
      "source_start": 134.814,
      "source_end": 137.001,
      "sequence_start": 147.11499999999992,
      "sequence_end": 149.30199999999994
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Do not use private operational data.",
      "source_start": 137.352,
      "source_end": 139.891,
      "sequence_start": 149.65299999999993,
      "sequence_end": 152.19199999999992
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Give every row the five columns.",
      "source_start": 140.211,
      "source_end": 142.558,
      "sequence_start": 152.51199999999992,
      "sequence_end": 154.8589999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Place the job, decision, source, receipt, memory proposal, and human owner.",
      "source_start": 142.814,
      "source_end": 148.403,
      "sequence_start": 155.11499999999992,
      "sequence_end": 160.70399999999992
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Label closed paths for spending, publication, and external messages.",
      "source_start": 148.702,
      "source_end": 152.951,
      "sequence_start": 161.0029999999999,
      "sequence_end": 165.25199999999992
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "Then trace one failed source check: the note is stale, the draft stops, and Morgan receives a reason.",
      "source_start": 153.232,
      "source_end": 159.824,
      "sequence_start": 165.53299999999993,
      "sequence_end": 172.12499999999997
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-07",
      "text": "We are making a design someone can review.",
      "source_start": 160.144,
      "source_end": 162.427,
      "sequence_start": 172.4449999999999,
      "sequence_end": 174.72799999999992
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-08",
      "text": "Save revision five as a draft.",
      "source_start": 162.832,
      "source_end": 164.811,
      "sequence_start": 220.07799999999992,
      "sequence_end": 222.0569999999999
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L05-08",
      "text": "A map earns its place when its blank cells stay visible and someone owns each repair.",
      "source_start": 165.125,
      "source_end": 170.75662131519275,
      "sequence_start": 222.37099999999992,
      "sequence_end": 228.00262131519264
    }
  ],
